---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site, telHref, mailHref, addressFull } from '../lib/site';
const updated = 'November 19, 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Graebridge Stone, LLC collects, uses, and protects the information you share through this website, our quote form, and phone calls."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <PageHero kicker="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />

  <article class="section policy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p><em>Last updated {updated}</em></p>
        <p>
          {site.legalName} ("{site.name}," "we," "us") operates this website. This policy explains what information we collect when
          you visit the site or contact us, how we use it, and the choices you have.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Information you send us.</strong> When you submit the quote request form we receive your name, phone number, email address, the service you are interested in, your message, and any photo you choose to upload.</li>
          <li><strong>Phone calls and text messages.</strong> When you call or text the number on this site we receive your phone number and the content of the call or message. Calls may be recorded, as described below.</li>
          <li><strong>Usage information.</strong> Like most websites, this site collects basic technical information automatically, such as the pages you view, the site that referred you, your approximate location (city level), and your browser and device type.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your request, prepare estimates, schedule templating and installation, and provide customer service.</li>
          <li>To understand how people find and use the site so we can improve it.</li>
          <li>To train our team and keep a record of what was discussed, in the case of recorded calls.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share it with other companies for their own marketing.</p>

        <h2>Service providers we use</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Formspree.</strong> Our quote form is processed by Formspree, which receives the information you submit and delivers it to us by email.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics and Google Tag Manager.</strong> We use Google Analytics, loaded through Google Tag Manager, to measure site traffic. Google uses cookies and similar technologies to collect usage information. You can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>CallRail.</strong> We use CallRail to route and track phone calls and text messages. The phone number shown on this site may be a tracking number that forwards to our shop, and CallRail uses a cookie to show a consistent number during your visit. <strong>Calls to and from that number may be recorded</strong> for quality and training purposes.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Maps and Instagram.</strong> The embedded map, and the Instagram feed when it is shown, are loaded from those services, which may collect information under their own privacy policies.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>These providers process information on our behalf or under their own terms. We share with them only what is needed for the services above.</p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses a small number of cookies set by the analytics and call tracking services listed above. You can block or delete
          cookies in your browser settings; the site will still work.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
        <p>
          We keep quote requests, messages, and call records for as long as we need them to serve you and to maintain ordinary business
          records, and we delete them when they are no longer needed.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Contact us using the details
          below and we will respond within a reasonable time.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>This site is intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>If we change this policy we will post the updated version on this page and revise the date at the top.</p>

        <h2>Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          {site.legalName}<br />
          {addressFull}<br />
          <a href={telHref} data-event="call_click" data-label="privacy">{site.phoneDisplay}</a><br />
          <a href={mailHref}>{site.email}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy { background: var(--white); padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); }
</style>
